&lt;p&gt;Expert-level knowledge of major digital ad platforms (Google Ads, Meta Ads, TikTok, programmatic DSPs, etc.) and a proactive approach to adopting new AI marketing technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional analytical skills with the ability to translate behavioral data sets into clear, actionable strategic improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
