&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are we looking for?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are seeking a Performance Lead – Booking Assistance to drive conversion performance and enhance customer experience across our global outsourced operations. In this role, you will bridge strategy and frontline execution to foster operational excellence across our BPO partner network. By combining strong leadership with sharp commercial acumen, you will establish robust governance, develop agent capabilities, and align vendor partners with our growth and satisfaction goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is a data-driven problem solver skilled at turning operational analytics into actionable insights and product improvements. You will analyse conversion funnels, identify drop-off causes, and partner with Service Excellence, Product, Tech, and Data teams to reduce booking friction. Whether shaping AI roadmaps or leading experiments, your ability to influence stakeholders and champion customer-first innovation will directly boost conversions and improve the booking journey.&lt;/p&gt;
