&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our Movement and Champion Restaurant Culture! 💚&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At TheFork we believe that the best things in life happen around the table. &lt;br&gt;As the leading restaurant booking platform in Europe, we connect the broadest community of loyal diners with the world’s favorite restaurants. Powered by innovation and a deep passion for the restaurant industry, we create unique dining experiences across 11 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re part of the Tripadvisor Group and proud to be building a diverse, people-first culture where “respect”, “ownership”, “growth” and “better together” values thrive. &lt;br&gt;If you’re passionate about food, technology, and making a real impact, your seat at the table is ready.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the UK, we operate in a fast-paced and highly competitive market, where success requires strong execution, resilience, and commercial drive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a high-performance, target-driven sales position, focused on new business acquisition, where you will own your pipeline, consistently deliver results, and contribute to the development of the wider team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.careers.thefork.com/&quot;&gt; Discover life at TheFork&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a desk-based role focused on outbound sales activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your day-to-day will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospecting restaurants via cold calls and outbound outreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conducting virtual meetings and product demos to present TheFork products and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing your own pipeline from first contact to closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiating and closing deals in a competitive environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Following up consistently with prospects to move deals forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding and ramp-up of new hires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share best practices and contribute to team performance improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a role model in terms of activity levels, pipeline management, and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide informal support to managers on day-to-day operational topics when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a highly proactive new business role focused on self-generated pipeline and outbound prospecting. Success in this position comes from consistency, ownership, and the ability to build strong commercial relationships in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
